# Lakeshore Apothecary: Vigilance, and "Whenever you draw your second card each turn, put a +1/+1 counter" (CR 603.2). It is cast on
# turn 3 after the turn's first draw (the draw step), so it was not there for the first card (the ruling: that doesn't matter). Ancestral Recall then draws three:
# the second of the turn triggers it once, the third and fourth don't (one counter, not three). On turn 5 the draw step's first card
# of that turn adds nothing; it attacks with vigilance, stays untapped, and deals 2.

